[[File:NinjaT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Ninjas are masters of the ancient art of combat and deception. Wielding swords, shurikens and other exotic weapons, they can vanish from plain sight to perform damaging sneak attacks. [[Ty|Master Ty]] once taught at the defunct [[Flying Dragon Dojo|Dragon Clan Dojo]] but now lives in [[Lakeshore]] and trains only those who are worthy.|Job description}}</font>''
'''Ninja''' is a close combat [[Jobs|job]], specializing in sneak attacks and confusion. A combat class job, experience is gained by completing Ninja [[Quests|quests]] and by battling in combat instances in the [[Wilds]] and in [[Dungeons|dungeons]].

==Restrictions - This job is locked for MEMBERS ONLY==
[[File:Members only.png|left]]
: As of December 5th 2009, this job is free to sample through level 4. You will be able to change into this job, but you will not be able to use it in combat until you purchase a ''[[Free Realms]] [[Membership|Membership]]. 

==Unlocking Ninja==
Ninja can be unlocked by speaking to [[Ty|Master Ty]] in southern [[Lakeshore]].

==Trainers==
*Ty in Lakeshore (starts quest job)
*Chloe in [[Blackspore Swamp]] (will block partway until lvl 5)
*[[Frostpetal]] in [[Snowhill]]
*Sakka in southwest of [[Wugachug]]
*Michi in Snowhill

